# OKF research edits

When editing files under `research/`:

- Concepts are document packages: `<slug>/document.md` + `convert.yaml`.
- `document.md` (not `index.md` / `log.md`) must keep YAML frontmatter with a non-empty `type`.
- Prefer recommended fields: `title`, `description`, `tags`, `timestamp`.
- Research findings must cite sources and link back to their topic: `topic: <slug>` in frontmatter plus a link to `/../topics/<slug>/topic.md`.
- Use bundle-relative absolute links: `[Title](/category/slug/document.md)`.
- Update category + root `research/index.md` when adding or renaming concepts.
- Add a newest-first entry to `research/log.md` for meaningful structural changes.
- After bulk edits, run `pnpm okf:check`.
